<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka T-bill yields fall at auction.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka T-bill yields fall at auction.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yields of three, six and 12-month Sri Lankan treasury bills fell at Monday's auction, which was heavily over-subscribed, with bids amounting to 7.995 billion rupees received, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>		  bids received   bids accepted   avg yield</p>
<p>    3 months     2,683	     1,278	  17.45 (17.72)</p>
<p>    6 months	 314		 164	  17.40 (17.66)</p>
<p>    12 months    4,998	     2,412	  17.38 (17.63)</p>
<p>NOTE - Bids in million rupees, yields in percent (previous week's yields in brackets).</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
